  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=30>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_1
    value: '<b><size=22>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>Bonus Symbol</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_BONUS
    value: "<size=18.5>- 3 types of Bonus symbols appear on reel 5.\n\n- 2 Scatters
      on reels 1 and 3 and a Bonus symbol on reel 5 determines\n   which bonus game
      will be played. </size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_WILD
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>Wild Symbol</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>BONUS GAMES FREE SPIN</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "<size=19.5>- Each bonus game has an initial free spin count of 5 free
      spins.\n\n- Whenever a Bonus symbol appears on reel 5, they get collected towards
      the respective bonus free\n   spin count.\n\n- Scatter symbols on reels 1 and
      3 with a Bonus symbol on reel 5 triggers a bonus game.\n\n- Bonus symbol type
      on reel 5 determines which bonus game will be played.\n\n- User will begin with
      the number of free spins collected upon the bonus game trigger.\n\n- Bonus symbols
      will not be collected during the bonus games.\n\n- When the bonus game is over,
      the free spins count on the respective bonus game becomes reset to\n   5 free
      spins.\n\n- Free spin count progress is saved separately for each bet level.\n\n-
      Up to 99 free spins may be collected for each of the 3 Bonus symbols.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>EXPANDING REELS BONUS GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "<size=25>- Scatters on reels 1 and 3 and the purple bonus symbol\n   on
      reel 5 triggers the Expanding Reels Bonus.\n\n- Reels expand to a 6x5 reel set
      with 60 lines.\n\n- If 2 scatters appear on reels 1 and 3 and the Expanding\n
      \  Reels Bonus symbol on reel 5, re-trigger bonus game\n   with 5 free spins.
      \n\n- During the Expanding Reels bonus game, randomly\n   trigger the Added
      Wild Symbol feature.\n\n- The bonus ends when no more free spins remains. </size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>EXPANDING WILD BONUS GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "<size=22\n>- Scatters on reels 1 and 3 and the pink bonus symbol on reel
      5\n   triggers the Expanding Wild Bonus.\n\n- Expanding Wild Bonus Games uses
      a 3x5 reel set, and reel 5\n   becomes a full stack of Wilds.\n\n- Whenever
      a Wild symbol appears on reels 1, 2, 3, or 4, all symbol\n   spots on that row
      between that Wild and the Wild on reel 5\n   becomes Wild. \n\n- During the
      Expanding Wild bonus game, randomly trigger the\n   Random Wilds feature. \n\n-
      Random Wilds feature adds Wilds randomly on reels 1, 2, 3, or 4.\n\n- Scatter
      and Bonus symbols do not appear during the this bonus.\n\n- The bonus ends when
      no more free spins remains.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>LINK BONUS GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "<size=25>- Scatters on reels 1 and 3 and the yellow bonus symbol\n   on
      reel 5 triggers the Link Bonus.\n\n- Link Bonus uses a 3x5 reel set, and each
      spot displays\n   either a Link symbol or a blank.\n\n- Link symbols have values
      ranging from 1x to 15x users\n   total bet.\n\n- If all 15 spots become filled
      with Link symbols while\n   free spins remain, calculate coin wins once before\n
      \  resetting all symbol spots to blanks. \n\n- The bonus ends when no more free
      spins remains.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_8
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>EXTRA BET</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_8
    value: "<size=25>- 66% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to trigger the Bonus
      Games. 50 Total Bet\n   includes 30 Base Bet and 20 Extra Bet.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_6
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_7
    value: <style=title><size=32><b>EXPANDING REELS LINES</size></style>
